{"description":"Create an image from shapes you compose yourself, without a template. Use this when no template fits, or the user wants a one-off design: a banner, a label, an invoice. Set the canvas size in `canvas`, then pass `shapes` in draw order: the first shape is at the back, the last on top. Every shape has `type`, `x`, `y`, `width` and `height`, in pixels from the top left of the canvas. Types and their required field: text (`text`), image (`src`), qrcode (`qrcode`), barcode (`barcode`), icon (`icon`, an Iconoir name such as `check-circle`), table (`columns` and `rows`). `frame` and `star` need no extra field. Set colours, borders, padding and fonts in `style`, using CSS property names.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"canvas":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"background":{"description":"A solid background. Defaults to white.","maxLength":64,"type":"string"},"backgroundImage":{"description":"A full canvas background: an https URL, a data URL, or a CSS gradient. Wins over background.","maxLength":8192,"type":"string"},"height":{"description":"Defaults to 630.","maximum":4096,"minimum":16,"type":"integer"},"objectFit":{"description":"How the background image fills the canvas. Defaults to cover.","enum":["cover","contain","none"],"type":"string"},"width":{"description":"Defaults to 1200.","maximum":4096,"minimum":16,"type":"integer"}},"type":"object"},"format":{"description":"Defaults to png.","enum":["png","jpeg","webp"],"type":"string"},"shapes":{"description":"The shapes to draw, in draw order: the first is at the back, the last on top.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"align":{"description":"Text and table: horizontal alignment. Defaults to left.","enum":["left","center","right"],"type":"string"},"backgroundColor":{"description":"A CSS colour, for example \"#111827\" or \"rgb(17 24 39)\".","maxLength":64,"type":"string"},"barcode":{"description":"Barcode: the value to enc